- Metric: delta in precision/recall/F1; set difference in pattern sets

**C4: Threshold sweep (τ sensitivity)**
- Run Docta on synthetic data with τ ∈ {0.001, 0.005, 0.01, 0.05, 0.10}
- Track: number of detected patterns, precision, recall at each τ
- Expected: precision decreases, recall increases as τ increases
- Purpose: identify optimal τ for the target precision-recall tradeoff

